": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L20z8su7HOYQ7kNvwF5d7r7&_nc_oc=Adqh5BlpAei58Bx24HnchmQVTlR8CmCi63rI_XalyK8_DLqmN6uFqRz20F1zDoQfUr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF70_8D74fGTusj38goYTh9rAUwaRuPMZYRm0dXmOaH2w&oe=6A92B857"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rsINPVIwQjEQ7kNvwE1Ipt6&_nc_oc=Adp9IQciVcd9AuEuUfdxCLC2paOPYziuqOmqyPPG5kMYZckEjL0xqaj0mpmMuUllQ9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG9f2OZY7wNBo2DxJOuOc1wlv498WUlS9dFjWAs00zY9Q&oe=6A92C24B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zeg6qeg2KbYQ7kNvwFhS6g2&_nc_oc=AdrQjAWqhzPW5FYRnPtgWEmfEIt5P1f2_1oVqRZoSBNrNiuce3s0HKlGRXS2akJ8Rlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH6vqId9PtVNydJ9n8wO6HghpJfKZszyrPAJT1pO_N4gQ&oe=6A92C34E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Kk3ODBWRTYQ7kNvwGr_wwA&_nc_oc=AdqP0kEfvgW0u7gAnib1iWq-tF52qlA0z5loQvr9r5fJ2pM6UAU_5yb1CAeKQX2v9j8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGh_hDcy7SUo2Z45Vx-gQ1BzPiOiCy6VBkwG9PyPRHtMQ&oe=6A92E4B6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TdqR6AfmXvMQ7kNvwHyXMNI&_nc_oc=Adr8_5pSsuP1jQzuqIGlfC9PkKv1wgSeToKTj9TdLDFkn21ztq3hVKsZgtO-qi5fHVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHWNgzDccGHrOkdZ_-lN43Dr9B52JCUNRTRy9bSJ0myxw&oe=6A92B854"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_h_LGihYXy4Q7kNvwESkS90&_nc_oc=AdoZBq_FDFUL9lHswXnBpQVqEdx9__nk2wvsq2yFDlPLs2r-iWxqzLdLi0lzWZR8HQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGj2pa2COkKmEjifyQdZzRf8NslVxn3QeNKGkSsUML1xQ&oe=6A92CD93"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco